<title>USA: Industrial Sci buys gas monitoring line.</title>
<headline>Industrial Sci buys gas monitoring line.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Scientific Corp said Friday that it has purchased all of the gas monitoring systems products manufactured by McNeill International for an undisclosed price.</p>
</text>
